<title>USA: Int'l Jensen merger vote to proceed.</title>
<headline>Int'l Jensen merger vote to proceed.</headline>
<dateline>LINCOLNSHIRE, Ill. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Jensen Inc said Monday the U.S. District Court denied a motion by Emerson Radio Corp to stop International Jensen's merger with Recoton Corp.</p>
<p>Emerson had sought a preliminary injunction from the U.S. District Court for the Northern District of Illinois.</p>
<p>International Jensen's shareholders are scheduled to vote on Recoton's proposal to acquire the company for $11 per share at a special meeting set for August 28.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
